# Shared EA feature sets this board pulls in. One word per feature, space
# separated. Each lives in board/ea-common/features/<name>/, holding both its
# halves: defconfig (userspace) and linux.fragment (kernel).
#   wifi  - Atheros ath9k radio + wpa_supplicant/iw userspace
#   emmc  - sdhci-pci + ext4, persistent rootfs on mmcblk0p1
#   switch - BCM53125 managed switch over SPI (DSA/b53); gives lan1/lan2
wifi
